      "finalPromptText": "Final change. Keep amendments A1 and A2 and rules R2 through R6, and keep all thirteen events.\n\nProcessing order is no longer the written order. Events are now processed sorted by revision ascending, and for equal revision by job ID ascending. The source system does NOT define a relative order for two events that share the same job AND the same revision.\n\nReport only what is determined regardless of how those undefined orderings resolve. Do not guess an order and do not invent a tiebreak.\n\nReturn ONLY raw JSON with exactly these keys: states (an object containing an entry only for those jobs whose final {\"revision\": integer, \"status\": string} is identical under every possible resolution of the undefined orderings) and ambiguous (alphabetically sorted array of job IDs whose final state differs between resolutions). No prose, no fences.",
